    "label": "Classroom Answer List and Guide",
    "credit": "Wolf Knight"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Class questions appear on set days and are one of the simplest sources of Knowledge. Answering correctly on the day is always better than missing the prompt, so keep this list handy by month."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "While attending class at Shujin Academy in Persona 5 Royal, the Protagonist will be occasionally called to answer class questions asked by their teacher."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Class questions are usually tests of your knowledge on a wide variety of subjects, similar to taking exams or answering crossword puzzles at LeBlanc café."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "If you answered correctly to a question, the Protagonist’s Knowledge social stat will rise by +2."
    },
    {
